Application interface icons use UIKit SF Symbols.

The home-screen application icon uses the native layered AppIcon.icon document.
Its headset geometry is adapted from Mumble's mumble_small.svg by Martin
Skilnand (2009), under the BSD license in Mumble-Translations-LICENSE.txt.
Icon Composer supplies the glass material, lighting and appearance variants.
Legacy icon/iconpad PNGs and the old iTunes artwork have been removed.
Xcode generates all packaged icon sizes, including older-iOS fallbacks, from
AppIcon.icon. Do not add duplicate raster app icons to Copy Bundle Resources.
Message attachments are user/server content and are not bundled interface artwork.

Interface translations include matching terminology from mumble-voip/mumble,
under the BSD license in Mumble-Translations-LICENSE.txt. The same notice is
bundled in Legal.html. New iOS-specific strings are translated for this app.
